<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said it would auction 3.3 billion pesos worth of Cetes at the primary auction on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    28  days     900 million pesos  28.69 pct</p>
<p>    91  days     900 million pesos  29.97 pct</p>
<p>    182 days     900 million pesos  25.53 pct</p>
<p>    364 days     600 million pesos  22.38 pct</p>
<p>The central bank also said it will offer 500 million pesos worth of 364-day Bondes and 500 million pesos worth of 728-day Bondes.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559</p>
</text>
